     ••   Aceeca Mez1000 RDA
     ••   Handspring Treo
     ••   Handspring Treo 600
     ••   Handspring Visor
     ••   Palm I705
     ••   Palm M125
     ••   Palm M130
     ••   Palm M500
     ••   Palm M505
     ••   Palm M515
     ••   Palm Tungsten T
     ••   Palm Tungsten Z
     ••   Palm Zire
     ••   Palm Zire 31
     ••   Sony Clie 4.0
     ••   Sony Clie 4.1
     ••   Sony Clie 5.0
     ••   Sony Clie PEG-S500C
     ••   Sony Clie NX60
     ••   Sony Clie S360
     ••   Sony Clie TJ37

FFIILLEESS
     /dev/ttyU*       for callin ports
     /dev/ttyU*.init
     /dev/ttyU*.lock  corresponding callin initial-state and lock-state de‐
                      vices

     /dev/cuaU*       for callout ports
     /dev/cuaU*.init
     /dev/cuaU*.lock  corresponding callout initial-state and lock-state de‐
                      vices

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     tty(4), ucom(4), usb(4)

